From c9fd0ee7023f37a6648ce75b3413339b8b68ecbd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sebastian Heimann <sebastian.heimann@gfz-potsdam.de>
Date: Mon, 1 Apr 2019 12:23:53 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] gf: fix low-level errors in time handling

Fixes an error introduced in ff78d61d9bea8d70389d64507f7f1ae40ba66b3a
which could lead to incorrect time information on synthetic seismograms
produced by LocalEngine.process.

diff --git a/src/gf/seismosizer.py b/src/gf/seismosizer.py
